    },
    "regime_notes": "Validation used all 15 tradable instruments and 1,289 dates with at least 8 valid instruments, average 12.00 valid instruments. Aggregate 5d and 10d predictive power was positive, while 20d decayed negative. The 10d calendar regime means were negative in 2026 (-0.122997) and positive in 2027 (0.048355), 2028 (0.048891), 2029 (0.027159), 2030 (0.025343), and 2031 YTD (0.025379). Interpret uncertainty conservatively for the small cross-section; no future data used.",
